{"id":72716,"date":"2026-11-03T11:36:28","date_gmt":"2026-11-03T11:36:28","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=72716"},"modified":"2026-11-03T12:40:13","modified_gmt":"2026-11-03T11:40:13","slug":"sao-silvestre-torres-novas","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/sao-silvestre-torres-novas\/","title":{"rendered":"S\u00e3o Silvestre Torres Novas 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">S\u00e3o Silvestre Torres Novas 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, <strong>19 de dezembro de 2026<\/strong>, levando o ambiente festivo do atletismo noturno ao cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de <strong>Torres Novas<\/strong>, no distrito de <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-santarem\/\">Santar\u00e9m<\/a>. Com epicentro na <strong>Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo<\/strong>, esta cl\u00e1ssica de fim de ano re\u00fane at\u00e9 1.500 participantes num final de tarde e noite que \u00e9 um dos pontos altos das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-dezembro\/\">corridas de dezembro<\/a> no Ribatejo.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A tarde desportiva arranca \u00e0s <strong>16:00<\/strong> com a <strong>Corrida de 5 km e Caminhada<\/strong>, que parte da Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo e termina junto ao emblem\u00e1tico <strong>Jardim das Rosas<\/strong>, nas margens do <strong>Rio Almonda<\/strong> e sob o olhar do hist\u00f3rico <strong>Castelo de Torres Novas<\/strong>. A partir das <strong>17:00<\/strong> entram em a\u00e7\u00e3o os escal\u00f5es de forma\u00e7\u00e3o da <strong>Prova Jovem<\/strong> (dos B\u00e2mbis aos Juvenis, entre 125 m e 2.500 m), culminando \u00e0s <strong>19:00<\/strong> com o tiro de partida dos <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-10km\/\">10 km<\/a> homologados pela Federa\u00e7\u00e3o Portuguesa de Atletismo e pela World Athletics \u2014 ideal para planeares o teu ritmo na nossa <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\">calculadora de pace<\/a>.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Promovida pelo <strong>Munic\u00edpio de Torres Novas<\/strong>, a prova distingue-se pelo forte apoio popular nas art\u00e9rias iluminadas da cidade, pelo pacote de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o acess\u00edvel (5,00 \u20ac nos 10 km, 4,00 \u20ac nos 5 km\/Caminhada e participa\u00e7\u00e3o gratuita na Prova Jovem) com t-shirt t\u00e9cnica inclu\u00edda, e por atribuir pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios at\u00e9 750,00 \u20ac aos cinco primeiros classificados da geral masculina e feminina nos 10 km. Esta prova integra o calend\u00e1rio oficial das <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/corridas-sao-silvestre\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Corridas de S\u00e3o Silvestre em Portugal<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">19 de Dezembro de 2026<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho & Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo, Torres Novas, Santar\u00e9m<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; bo