trong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Prova Jovem (B\u00e2mbis a Juvenis)<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 17:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Obrigat\u00f3ria:<\/strong> 0,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (at\u00e9 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\"><div style=\"flex: 1; min-width: 200px;\"><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 19 de Dezembro de 2026 \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 19:00<\/span><\/div><div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\"><div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">Inscri\u00e7\u00e3o Geral:<\/strong> 5,00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (14\/09 a 13\/12\/2026)<\/span><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/div><\/ul><\/div><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 19 de dezembro de 2026. O programa come\u00e7a \u00e0s 16:00 com a Corrida de 5 km e Caminhada, segue-se a Prova Jovem entre as 17:00 e as 17:55 (B\u00e2mbis \u00e0s 17:00\/17:05, Benjamins \u00e0s 17:10\/17:15, Infantis \u00e0s 17:20\/17:30, Iniciados \u00e0s 17:40 e Juvenis \u00e0s 17:55) e a Corrida principal de 10 km parte \u00e0s 19:00.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o local de partida e de chegada das provas em Torres Novas?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Corrida principal de 10 km e os cinco percursos da Prova Jovem t\u00eam partida e chegada na Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo, em Torres Novas. J\u00e1 a Corrida de 5 km e a Caminhada partem da Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo e terminam no Jardim das Rosas.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual o prazo limite para participar?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 13 de dezembro de 2026 (ou at\u00e9 atingir o limite m\u00e1ximo de 1.500 inscritos) e t\u00eam o valor de 5,00 \u20ac para a Corrida de 10 km e 4,00 \u20ac para a Corrida de 5 km \/ Caminhada. A Prova Jovem \u00e9 gratuita, mas de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o pr\u00e9via obrigat\u00f3ria.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 feito o levantamento do kit de atleta e dorsal?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O kit do atleta (composto por t-shirt t\u00e9cnica unissexo, dorsal, chip de cronometragem nos 10 km e Prova Jovem, e refor\u00e7o alimentar) \u00e9 entregue nas Piscinas Municipais Fernando Cunha na sexta-feira, 18 de dezembro de 2026, das 14:00 \u00e0s 20:00, e no s\u00e1bado, dia da prova (19 de dezembro), das 09:00 \u00e0s 18:30.<\/div><\/details><details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\"><summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 o tempo limite, abastecimentos e pr\u00e9mios da Corrida de 10 km?<\/summary><div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A Corrida de 10 km tem um tempo limite m\u00e1ximo de 1h30 (tr\u00e2nsito restabelecido \u00e0s 21:15) e conta com abastecimento l\u00edquido aos 5 km e na meta. S\u00e3o atribu\u00eddos pr\u00e9mios monet\u00e1rios aos 5 primeiros da geral masculina e feminina (750 \u20ac, 500 \u20ac, 300 \u20ac, 200 \u20ac e 100 \u20ac), trof\u00e9us aos 3 primeiros da geral e equipas, e medalhas aos 3 primeiros de cada escal\u00e3o.<\/div><\/details><\/div><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"S\u00e3o Silvestre Torres Novas 2026\", \"startDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"endDate\": \"2026-12-19\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo, Torres Novas\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Torres Novas\", \"addressRegion\": \"Santar\u00e9m\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"description\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026 realiza-se a 19 de dezembro em Torres Novas, com 10 km, 5 km, Caminhada e Prova Jovem. Consulta hor\u00e1rios e inscreve-te j\u00e1!\", \"image\": [\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/11\/cartaz-sao-silvestre-torres-novas.webp\"], \"offers\": [{\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida 5 km \/ Caminhada\", \"price\": \"4.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.bol.pt\/Comprar\/Bilhetes\/184392-sao_silvestre_2026-torres_novas\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Prova Jovem (B\u00e2mbis a Juvenis)\", \"price\": \"0\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.bol.pt\/Comprar\/Bilhetes\/184392-sao_silvestre_2026-torres_novas\/\"}, {\"@type\": \"Offer\", \"name\": \"Corrida de S\u00e3o Silvestre 10 km\", \"price\": \"5.00\", \"priceCurrency\": \"EUR\", \"availability\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/InStock\", \"url\": \"https:\/\/www.bol.pt\/Comprar\/Bilhetes\/184392-sao_silvestre_2026-torres_novas\/\"}], \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Munic\u00edpio de Torres Novas\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e a que horas se realiza a S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A S\u00e3o Silvestre de Torres Novas 2026 realiza-se no s\u00e1bado, 19 de dezembro de 2026. O programa come\u00e7a \u00e0s 16:00 com a Corrida de 5 km e Caminhada, segue-se a Prova Jovem entre as 17:00 e as 17:55 (B\u00e2mbis \u00e0s 17:00\/17:05, Benjamins \u00e0s 17:10\/17:15, Infantis \u00e0s 17:20\/17:30, Iniciados \u00e0s 17:40 e Juvenis \u00e0s 17:55) e a Corrida principal de 10 km parte \u00e0s 19:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o local de partida e de chegada das provas em Torres Novas?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A Corrida principal de 10 km e os cinco percursos da Prova Jovem t\u00eam partida e chegada na Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo, em Torres Novas. J\u00e1 a Corrida de 5 km e a Caminhada partem da Avenida Dr. Jo\u00e3o Martins de Azevedo e terminam no Jardim das Rosas.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 o pre\u00e7o de inscri\u00e7\u00e3o e qual o prazo limite para participar?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es decorrem at\u00e9 13 de dezembro de 2026 (ou at\u00e9 atingir o l